{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Yukari  >Deep below the Asama Purifying Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a grueling battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However...”"
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“A torrent of impurity from the Outside World will also rush in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> What happens after that... is in your hands.”"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“Why don’t you witness for yourself how Gensokyo changes?”"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa's House."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A cozy little magic house in the Forest of Magic."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“You called?”"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Aah! No, I didn’t! I really didn’t!”"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“Well, it’s about time you did.",
                "<l$> You were looking into the Incident Stone, weren’t you?”"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“How do you know about that...?”"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“Because, after all, I’m the one who bestowed it upon you.”"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“You’re kidding!?”"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“And you used it to avert the incident, didn’t you?”"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Alright. Gimme the full story.”"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“In the Outside World, something called ‘artificial intelligence’, also known as ‘AI’,",
                "<l$> is trying to debase vast quantities of truth into fiction."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Because of that, a huge flood of information was bound to flow into Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> If left unchecked, it would throw Gensokyo into chaos."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“If information from living beings, the so-called ‘impurity’, reaches the Lunar Capital,",
                "<l$> it wouldn’t be able to maintain its eternity, and would surely collapse."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However, the Lunar Capital was facing an even greater crisis.”"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> After all, the Capital is built on nothing but",
                "<l$> a magnificent foundation of selected, beautiful information.”"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Huh, I see...?”"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wha-?!”"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“They’re so considerate, aren’t they? Giving us a proper warning."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Alright, you lost me.”"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> So, after that, I thought it over. Using the little brains I have."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thus, the conceived plan was as follow:",
                "<l$> to fight incident with incident, and accept the change."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“The Lunarians caused this incident so the influx of information",
                "<l$> from the outside could be rendered harmless."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> In fact, they consulted me before the incident began."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> They said that with or without this plan, Gensokyo would likely perish anyway.”"
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“It’s simple, really. We just gave you humans the very power of an incident",
                "<l$> to outmaneuver the Lunarians’ scheme.\""
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“So, did you come up with that weird plan all by yourself?”"
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yukari  >“No, it was a gambit devised by those who love Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> All I did was slip you the stone."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa was dumbfounded."
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even so, she wondered just who “those who love Gensokyo” were."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“That Incident Stone was certainly the real deal."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thanks to you, I can take some time off work. I'm grateful.”"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wait, return Gensokyo to normal first!”"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“You needn’t worry. Once I withdraw my power, Gensokyo should return to normal."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“What? ‘In my hands’...? What do you mean?”"
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Something like imbuing a stone with the power of an incident",
                "<l$> is far beyond my own abilities...”"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This incident, the youkai of Gensokyo giving up change and losing their power,",
                "and also her own efforts to save them: it was all a plan devised to save themselves."
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "While it was hard to swallow in the moment, she was forced to accept it",
                "when she saw the youkai in front of her knew everything."
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That one who used to live on the Moon, that one who’s always the mastermind in the shadows..."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could there be others?"
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps even Ariya was in on it too?"
            ]
        },
        "48_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Furthermore, who created the Incident Stone? There weren’t enough answers to her questions."
            ]
        },
        "49_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.11 — A Desperate Gambit$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}